SUMMARY:Earth Day Art Show
LOCATION:102 E. German Street 
DESCRIPTION:Gather up your recyclables and turn them into art!\nBring your artwork to be displayed at the War Memorial Building. Entries will be open for community to vote. Prizes will be awarded!\nTransport your artwork to 102 E German St as early as 8am on April 24th and pick up by 6pm on April 25th. Art will be on display all day Sunday and open for the public to view.\nCriteria:\nPreschool-12th grade\nMust contain 50% recycled materials\nArtwork should be family-friendly\nAll media welcome\nRegister here: https://forms.gle/ggRMPEkWQHBVt2vM8
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Film & Performing Arts
ORGANIZATION:Shepherdstown Community Club
URL:https://www.shepherdstowncommunityclub.org/events/earth-day-art-show
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstowncommunityclub.org
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
